    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- Ki +2 and ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Chance of evading enemy's attack 25%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- \"Crossover\" or \"Mission Execution\" Category allies' ATK 30%{passiveImg:up_g}\nfor 2 turns\n*When attacking with 12 or more Ki*\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g} and if HP is 80% or less or when facing\n2 or more enemies, plus an additional ATK 150%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*As the 2nd or 3rd attacker in a turn*\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Chance of evading enemy's attack 20%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*As the 3rd attacker in a turn*\n- Launches an additional attack that has a great chance of\nbecoming a Super Attack\n*When receiving a normal attack*\n- Damage reduction rate 60%{passiveImg:up_g} temporarily\n*When receiving a Super Attack*\n- Chance of evading enemy's attack 30%{passiveImg:up_g} temporarily\n*When 3 or more \"Crossover\" or \"Mission Execution\" Category allies\nare on the team, or when there are 3 Super Class allies attacking\nin the same turn*\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Great chance of performing a critical hit\n- Interrupts the attacked enemy",
